# CR 700.13 names only opponents, what they control and cards in their graveyards. Bot1 aims Lightning Bolt at
# itself and a second one at its own Llanowar Elves: neither is a crime, so Raven of Fell Omens never triggers
# (Bot2 stays at 20) and Bot1 has no crimes. The positive control is
# crime-lightning-bolt-at-an-opponent-commits-a-crime, the same Bolt at Bot2.

